[{"type":"message","user":"U02894EN7A6","text":"\u003c@U02894EN7A6\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1626780787.371000","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"9e8b2bea-e6f4-40d0-8e16-461b5a9af25d","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"閃光のハサウェイはパッケージを劇場で売ってましたね","ts":"1626756268.370700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JZTp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d14c597-c70e-45d3-9634-bc3bdd84d2c1","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"コロナ下だと積極的に劇場に行く気にはならない","ts":"1626743854.369900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P7T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7eb0b3c2-acca-4360-9fd1-c0e8df4960f9","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"たのしみ","ts":"1626743721.369200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iTkb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9459fc04-81eb-4343-985d-5700876ba25f","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ついに配信来た","ts":"1626743719.369000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uwnyR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6a85b6b-fa3e-4a5d-8a77-1ac7ec028db7","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"あとは単純に劇場離れも見越したか\n海外での配信決定はコロナもあっての話だったような","ts":"1626743707.368800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1gQx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da129b5e-3b36-4bf8-9ae2-ad0c4bf34b6c","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"そのうち、\n配信公開 → 劇場公開 → パッケージ販売\nくらいの順番になるかもしれない。","ts":"1626743687.368300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"auD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8a566eb-b62f-4d83-b4d3-b24c33c4066b","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"パッケージ販売 →  配信公開\nより、\n配信公開 → パッケージ販売\nの方が収益が大きくなる可能性があると踏んだってことですよね。","ts":"1626743653.367500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZZ9IR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6f7b0bd-3dce-44cb-99a1-d630634dc0d2","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"それなら日付を置く意味とは？","ts":"1626743599.366400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/8=A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2488a6c4-c66b-4493-9975-8a09f9445cc1","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"逆にマニア以外は買わない","ts":"1626743585.365700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2CwW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"172473ff-0aa3-482f-aef9-86882613235d","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"配信されていても手元に置いておきたいマニア層は買うだろう","ts":"1626743577.365400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"19j7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bf1da56-b289-47ff-a1d6-19e28d4ea963","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"まあパッケージ売れないのは本当にそう\n無限列車は例外的な売れ方してたみたいですけど","ts":"1626743571.365200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+V=5K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"485901a8-c6f7-4389-8c40-07409b05aef1","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"パッケージと配信って、あんまりカニばらないと思うんですけどね","ts":"1626743551.364300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hilK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08caa046-ef81-47d4-8c3e-dd3da21bd840","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"大衆には届かない","ts":"1626743548.364200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X4T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"edde0b2c-6e7d-440e-936f-cd2f6db45ed6","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"パッケージは本当にマニア向けになってしまったから","ts":"1626743539.363600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cao"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fac9b28d-7286-401f-a155-665569973419","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"サブスク系って製作元にインセンティブあるんですね","ts":"1626743530.363100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H=A2A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"461f5374-acd9-4120-a488-3b404cc4cf53","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"これは人が見れば見るほどお金が支払われるはずだ","ts":"1626743516.362700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TgJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77c99d2c-cfe7-4ccc-b3b0-8e69ff41998d","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"それならすぐに出した方が話題性が高く配信で人気になる＝収入が増える","ts":"1626743505.362000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h3I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd04a998-b0c8-4213-b48b-7972251b94d7","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"パッケージ売れないからじゃないか","ts":"1626743472.360600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qaX2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa320913-2d93-4bed-acb0-587022328b51","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"公開が終ってすぐネットで見れるなんて、時代は変わったなー\nついに、優先度が「配信 \u0026gt; パッケージ」って感じになったんだな。","ts":"1626743448.360200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0jiS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3537c32b-3b24-4ca0-ad70-ef7b27880459","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"これはみたいな","ts":"1626743447.360100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SNly"}]},{"client_msg_id":"082af794-e465-4540-9a89-e4e3be3c518e","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"オッ","ts":"1626743443.359900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=SL"}]},{"clien